Air conditioners, household refrigerators and washing machines under 10 to 20 per cent increased tariffs from 10 to 20 per cent, increased charges on air conditioners, air conditioners and refrigerators from 7.5 per cent to 15 per cent, increased from 15 per cent on the speaker to 15 per cent, increased from 20 per cent on footwear to 15 per cent.
Similarly, import duty has been increased from 15 per cent to 20 per cent for jewellery, gold or other precious metal or other precious metal, gold or silver utensils.
These charges have been increased from 10 per cent to 15 per cent and five per cent on such plastic products, shower baths, sinks, wash basins, cans, containers, tableware, kitchenware and other household products, office stationery, furniture fittings, as well as trunks, suitcash, trevel bags and other bags, etc.
